Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:10.20,opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Witness a miracle born from fossils.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.10,0:00:14.80,opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Once upon a time, in a certain place...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.86,0:00:18.55,opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Prehistoric creatures full of personality!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.58,0:00:21.95,opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Tirano, Stego, Ammonite,Trilobite.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:25.99,opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}They've been saying "hi" for 500 million years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:30.20,opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Prehistory! Everybody Say (Roar!)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.20,0:00:32.68,opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Ancient, Alright! Future, FLY High!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.68,0:00:35.50,opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}A herd of mammoths! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:40.30,opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Thud thud thud thud! On your marks, get set, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.16,0:00:44.00,opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Dive deep into serious learning,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.10,0:00:46.05,opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}and get excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.08,0:00:49.30,opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Witness a miracle born from fossils.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.80,0:00:51.75,opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Dive deep into serious learning,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.75,0:00:53.53,opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Playing for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.70,0:00:56.70,opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}The universe begins with passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.30,0:01:00.02,opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Super happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.04,0:01:04.45,titulo do ep,,0,0,0,,{\an3\b1}Serious Steller's Sea Cow Certification Committee{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.04,0:01:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.38,0:01:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,the Serious Prehistoric Creature Certification Committee!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.53,0:01:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.69,0:01:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the Serious Prehistoric Creature Certification Committee?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.05,0:01:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a committee where people who love prehistoric creatures
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.55,0:01:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,gather to arbitrarily certify whether the target creature is a true prehistoric creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.05,0:01:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And today's topic is...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.78,0:01:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,the Steller's sea cow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.22,0:01:24.15,"Steller's Sea Cow",,0,0,0,,"Steller's Sea Cow"\NDiscovered 1741 – Extinct 1768
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.65,0:01:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,President!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.60,0:01:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Objection!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.45,0:01:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It spoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.40,0:01:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.06,0:01:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Makoto Fukui!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.37,0:01:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You're saying his full name!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.52,0:01:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Steller's sea cow is too recent historically
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.16,0:01:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,, to be called a true prehistoric creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.51,0:01:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I also agree with Mr. Fukui.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.23,0:01:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,BeloBets-san is against it too?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.45,0:01:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, BeloBets? \NAs in that super rich guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.90,0:01:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.16,0:01:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Mr. Fukui must be an amazing person too!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.09,0:01:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a part-timer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.68,0:01:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.60,0:01:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I might have the same opinion as Mr. Fukui too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.96,0:01:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.26,0:02:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,that way of speaking...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.02,0:02:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.39,0:02:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Idol singer Yano-chan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.65,0:02:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.06,0:02:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a huge fan! Get an autograph for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.27,0:02:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We've never met in real life, so that's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.53,0:02:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.53,0:02:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,who is that Iguanodon person?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.59,0:02:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Mistery-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.09,0:02:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,A person where everything is a mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.09,0:02:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They're eating something, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.80,0:02:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think about this matter, Kanna-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.57,0:02:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.32,0:02:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,In the first place, \NI don't even know what a Steller's sea cow is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.21,0:02:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let me teach you about the biology of the Steller's sea cow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.21,0:02:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Total length about 8 meters,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.90,0:02:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,thick skin of 2.5 cm,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.01,0:02:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,fat layer up to 20 cm,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.69,0:02:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,and weight around 4 tons!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.08,0:02:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This creature might actually be cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.49,0:02:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Its staple food was kelp;
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.69,0:02:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,it had no teeth and ground kelp using keratinous plates!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.32,0:02:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The way it eats is cute too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.62,0:03:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Since it's cute, shouldn't we just count it as a true prehistoric creature?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.72,0:03:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Objection!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.49,0:03:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Being cute has nothing to do with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.96,0:03:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,In the first place,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.48,0:03:10.28,Steller's Sea Cow(2nd),,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFF897&}Steller's Sea Cow
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.20,0:03:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,which are herbivorous, close to modern dugongs,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.20,0:03:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,making it far too recent to be called a prehistoric creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.70,0:03:14.80,Steller's Sea Cow(2nd),,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFF897&}Dugong
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.20,0:03:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Above all, shouldn't a prehistoric creature be based on fossils?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.81,0:03:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I have an objection.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.23,0:03:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,President!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.58,0:03:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Steller's sea cows existed from 2 million years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.24,0:03:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,and fossils have indeed been found!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.28,0:03:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.16,0:03:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did they go extinct then?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.03,0:03:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,To be precise,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.18,0:03:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Steller's sea cows didn't just go extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.71,0:03:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,, They were exterminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.45,0:03:39.24,Extermination,,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBFBFF&}Extermination
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.98,0:03:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Ex....
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.14,0:03:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Exterminated...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.64,0:03:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Extermination means
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.87,0:03:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,a species was driven to extinction by human hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.12,0:03:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,In 1741,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.22,0:03:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,when the Bering expedition was shipwrecked,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.02,0:03:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Georg Wilhelm Steller discovered
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.28,0:03:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,the Steller's sea cow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.79,0:04:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They were able to survive by using Steller's sea cows as food.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.36,0:04:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,After returning home,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.14,0:04:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Steller reported that their meat tasted like beef.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.43,0:04:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Word of their existence spread...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.11,0:04:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,and in just 27 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.69,0:04:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,they were completely exterminated!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.11,0:04:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,As a lesson so we never forget them,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.16,0:04:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.45,0:04:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,we should certify the Steller's sea cow as a true prehistoric creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.97,0:04:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,President Tetori...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.22,0:04:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.80,0:04:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.41,0:04:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll raise money to make a plastic model of the Steller's sea cow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.46,0:04:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And then stealth market it on social media!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.00,0:04:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Stealth marketing is not allowed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.92,0:04:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.69,0:04:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Dugongs, a relative of Steller's sea cow,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.67,0:04:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,can be seen at Toba Aquarium!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.00,0:04:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,, Go check them out, everyone!
